   "caption": "Fungal growth and development on the cotyledons of B. napus cv. Westar, Surpass400, and 01-23-2-1 inoculated with L. maculans isolates H75 8-1/H77 7-2, as shown by trypan blue staining. Hyphae (red arrows) started to grow on the cotyledon tissue at 5 dpi. The compatible (Westar–H75 8-1/–H77 7-2) and intermediate incompatible (Surpass400–H75 8-1) interactions allowed for the formation of pycnidia (black hollow arrows) at 7 dpi and the fungal tissues formed pycnidia at only 11 dpi. The incompatible interactions (Surpass400–H77 7-2 and 01-23-2-1–H75 8-1/–H77 7-2) did not have pycnidia and only few hyphae grew up to 7 dpi and 11 dpi. The images were taken at 100× magnification.",
